            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Before the new one: say the Tamil for a prisoner, then the Tamil for to confess."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: கடத்து",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "கடத்து — kaṭattu — \"to smuggle; to kidnap\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "அன்று காவலர்கள் வராமல் இருந்திருந்தால், அவர்கள் தங்கத்தைக் கடத்தியிருப்பார்கள். aṉṟu kāvalarkaḷ varāmal iruntiruntāl, avarkaḷ taṅkattaik kaṭattiyiruppārkaḷ. If the police had not come that day, they would have smuggled the gold."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (I …): கடத்தினேன், kaṭattiṉēṉ."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "What is carried off takes -ஐ; also to kidnap: குழந்தையைக் கடத்தினார்கள்."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "கடத்து (kaṭattu) is native Dravidian: DEDR 1109 gives it as the causative of கட, \"to cross\", so to smuggle is to make something cross."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for telling what happened."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 4,
          "type": "guided-production",
          "title": "Guided Practice",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "pause",
              "seconds": 1,
              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 1s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "prompt",
              "action": "SAY",
              "instruction": "kaṭattu",
              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU SAY: *kaṭattu*]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "prompt",
              "action": "SAY",
              "instruction": "kaṭattu, once more",
              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU SAY: *kaṭattu*, once more]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "prompt",
              "action": "SAY",
              "instruction": "aṉṟu kāvalarkaḷ varāmal iruntiruntāl, avarkaḷ taṅkattaik kaṭattiyiruppārkaḷ. — If the police had not come that day, they would have smuggled the gold.",
              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU SAY: *aṉṟu kāvalarkaḷ varāmal iruntiruntāl, avarkaḷ taṅkattaik kaṭattiyiruppārkaḷ.* — If the police had not come that day, they would have smuggled the gold.]"
            },
            {
