          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "புலனாய்வு (pulaṉāyvu) is a Tamil compound built from புலன், \"the senses, perception\", and ஆய்வு, \"examination\", from ஆய், \"to search, examine\" (DEDR 363)."
